    {
      "id": "claim_44dae851e0964d09ad43f9d4b0bb654c",
      "statement": "The entrypoint rewrites the four DB connection keys (ZM_DB_HOST, ZM_DB_USER, ZM_DB_PASS, ZM_DB_NAME) in /etc/zm/zm.conf with runtime environment values via whole-line sed replacements; these lines sit after the exec \"$@\" handoff, so they execute in the normal no-CMD path but are skipped under a command override.",
