      "id": "claim_238fa0e33d0f40b7a02dd8aff0386a09",
      "statement": "The final startup sequence runs `service apache2 start` then `service zoneminder start` and blocks on `tail -f /dev/null` to keep PID 1 alive; the Docker HEALTHCHECK `curl -f http://localhost/zm/` probes the Apache-fronted UI. Under a command override this sequence is skipped via the exec \"$@\" shell replacement.",
